{
  "$schema": "../../level.schema.json",
  "id": "7.7",
  "chapter": 7,
  "number": 7,
  "title": "Boss: ship a task end to end",
  "concept": "Issue to merged pull request, with a review and a tidy finish",
  "boss": true,
  "story": [
    {
      "speaker": "Priya",
      "text": "Last one before the festival. Issue #1 is the accessibility note for the site."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ada",
      "text": "Do the whole cycle on your own this time. You know every step."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ada",
      "text": "Task, branch, commit, push, pull request, handle the review, merge, tidy up."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ada",
      "text": "I will review it as soon as the pull request appears."
    }
  ],
  "workdir": "~/festival",
  "setup": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "run": "git init"
      },
      {
        "commit": {
          "message": "Festival site so far",
          "files": {
            "index.html": "<h1>Lantern Festival</h1>\n",
            "README.md": "The Lantern Labs festival website\n",
            "food.html": "<h2>Food stalls</h2>\n"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "hosted": {
          "id": "lantern-labs/festival-site",
          "visibility": "public",
          "defaultBranch": "main",
          "collaborators": [
            "ada-okafor",
            "sam-builds",
            "priya-reviews"
          ],
          "fromLocal": {
            "setUpstream": true
          },
          "labels": [
            {
              "name": "accessibility",
              "color": "#009E73"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "hub": {
          "type": "createIssue",
          "actor": "priya-reviews",
          "repo": "lantern-labs/festival-site",
          "title": "Add an access.html page",
          "body": "Please add access.html. It must say the site is wheelchair accessible and that there is a step-free route.",
          "labels": [
            "accessibility"
          ],
          "assignees": [
            "{{player.handle}}"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "teammates": [
    {
      "id": "ada-approves",
      "when": {
        "on": "event",
        "event": "hub.pr.open"
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "say",
          "speaker": "Ada",
          "text": "Reading it now... looks right. Approved, go ahead and merge."
        },
        {
          "type": "hub",
          "action": {
            "type": "reviewPullRequest",
            "actor": "ada-okafor",
            "repo": "lantern-labs/festival-site",
            "number": 2,
            "event": "approve",
            "body": "Clear and complete. Approved."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "goal": {
    "items": [
      {
        "text": "Commit the work on a branch, not straight on main",
        "checks": [
          {
            "type": "branchExists",
            "name": "access-note"
          },
          {
            "type": "commitExists",
            "on": "--all",
            "changes": [
              "access.html"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "access.html mentions wheelchair access and a step-free route",
        "checks": [
          {
            "type": "hostedFile",
            "repo": "lantern-labs/festival-site",
            "branch": "main",
            "path": "access.html",
            "contains": "wheelchair"
          },
          {
            "type": "hostedFile",
            "repo": "lantern-labs/festival-site",
            "branch": "main",
            "path": "access.html",
            "contains": "step-free"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A pull request was opened, approved and merged",
        "checks": [
          {
            "type": "pullRequest",
            "repo": "lantern-labs/festival-site",
            "head": "access-note",
            "state": "merged",
            "approved": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Tidy finish: branch gone, local main up to date",
        "checks": [
          {
            "type": "hostedBranch",
            "repo": "lantern-labs/festival-site",
            "branch": "access-note",
            "exists": false
          },
          {
            "type": "currentBranch",
            "name": "main"
          },
          {
            "type": "fileExists",
            "path": "access.html"
          },
          {
            "type": "inSync",
            "branch": "main"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "par": 6,
  "allowedCommands": null,
  "hints": [
    "Follow the same order as the whole chapter: branch, commit, push, pull request, merge, delete, pull.",
    "Name the branch `access-note`. After merging on the website, delete the branch and pull into your local main.",
    "`git switch -c access-note`, write access.html with \"wheelchair\" and \"step-free\", `git add access.html`, `git commit -m \"Add access note\"`, `git push -u origin access-note`, open a pull request in the panel, merge it, delete the branch, then `git switch main` and `git pull`."
  ],
  "questions": [],
  "recap": "You took a task from an issue all the way to merged main: branch, commit, push, pull request, review, merge, clean up, and pull. That is the real loop of team work.",
  "glossary": [],
  "cheatSheet": [],
  "predict": null,
  "ui": {
    "panels": {
      "hub": true,
      "remote": true
    },
    "hubPage": "lantern-labs/festival-site/issues/1"
  },
  "solution": [
    {
      "run": "git switch -c access-note"
    },
    {
      "run": "echo \"<h2>Access</h2><p>The site is wheelchair accessible. There is a step-free route from the main gate.</p>\" > access.html"
    },
    {
      "run": "git add access.html"
    },
    {
      "run": "git commit -m \"Add access note\""
    },
    {
      "run": "git push -u origin access-note"
    },
    {
      "hub": {
        "type": "openPullRequest",
        "repo": "lantern-labs/festival-site",
        "head": "access-note",
        "base": "main",
        "title": "Add access note",
        "body": "Closes #1."
      }
    },
    {
      "hub": {
        "type": "mergePullRequest",
        "repo": "lantern-labs/festival-site",
        "number": 2,
        "method": "merge"
      }
    },
    {
      "hub": {
        "type": "deleteBranch",
        "repo": "lantern-labs/festival-site",
        "branch": "access-note"
      }
    },
    {
      "run": "git switch main"
    },
    {
      "run": "git pull"
    }
  ]
}
